            "Provided first-class white-glove IT support and onboarding experiences",
        ],
        tags: ["INFRASTRUCTURE", "SUPPORT", "JAMF", "MDM"],
    },
    {
        title: "CORPORATE ENGINEERING MANAGER",
        company: "Ferocia",
        companyUrl: "https://ferocia.com.au/",
